An ingest whose rotation fdatasync fails, with no memory to publish the
degraded state, throws std::bad_alloc in the I/O error's place. Both the sync
before a mid-slice rotation and the one after the last chunk. Reverts #618.
Guarded-by: "alloc sweep: ingest whose rotation fdatasync fails"

